# Never let git touch line endings on the published artifacts.
#
# GitHub raw serves exactly what is committed. An M3U checked out with CRLF on
# Windows and committed back would ship CRLF to every subscriber, and players
# differ on whether they tolerate it -- the failure looks like a corrupt
# playlist rather than a line-ending problem, so it is expensive to diagnose.
*.m3u   -text
*.xml   -text
*.gz    binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.gif   binary
